<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
        <p>Your privacy is important to us. This privacy policy explains how E-Insurance collects, uses, and protects your personal information.</p>
        
        <h5>Information We Collect</h5>
        <ul>
            <li>Personal identification information (Name, email address, phone number, etc.)</li>
            <li>Policy and payment information</li>
            <li>Usage data and preferences</li>
