        </ul>
        
        <h5>Data Security</h5>
        <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>
        
        <h5>Contact Us</h5>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@einsurance.com</p>
